# SlayZone Env Vars — Standalone Hub & Runner

Deployment-relevant vars for standalone (non-supervised) hub + runner. Dev/e2e/electron-internal vars omitted.

**Precedence everywhere:** `env var > SLAYZONE_RUNNER_CONFIG file (runner) > ~/.slayzone/config.json > generated/default`

🗑️ = redundant surface; don't advertise for standalone (code stays — Electron app still needs `SLAYZONE_DB_DIR`).

| Category | Var | Purpose | Default | config.json key | Anchored to | Remove? |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Hub | `SLAYZONE_DB_PATH` | Exact SQLite file path (overrides dir+name) | — (composed from STORE_DIR + DB_NAME) | `dbPath` | — (absolute) | |
| Hub | `SLAYZONE_STORE_DIR` | State root: DB, logs/, diagnostics | `getStateDir()` (`~/Library/…` mac) | — | **home** | |
| Hub | `SLAYZONE_DB_DIR` | DB dir (dup of STORE_DIR, lower prio) | falls to STORE_DIR | — | home | 🗑️ |
| Hub | `SLAYZONE_DB_NAME` | DB filename (rename — never used on server) | `slayzone[.dev].sqlite` | — | — | 🗑️ |
| Hub | `SLAYZONE_PORT` | Client-facing tRPC/HTTP port | OS-assigned | `port` | — | |
| Hub | `SLAYZONE_HOST` | Bind addr for /trpc (client) | `127.0.0.1` | — | — | |
| Hub | `SLAYZONE_RUNNER_TRANSPORT_PORT` | `/runners` wss listener port | OS-assigned (stable via DB) | `runnerTransportPort` | — | |
| Hub | `SLAYZONE_RUNNER_TRANSPORT_HOST` | `/runners` bind addr | `0.0.0.0` | — | — | |
| Hub | `SLAYZONE_HUB_TLS_PORT` | TLS `/trpc` https port (opt-in) | OS-assigned | — | — | |
| Hub | `SLAYZONE_RUNNER_TRANSPORT_SECRET` | HMAC secret; runner-auth + token mint | gen+persist 256-bit | `runnerTransportSecret` | home (config.json) | |
| Hub | `SLAYZONE_HUB_PUBLIC_URL` | Public base URL advertised to remote MCP | derived loopback | `publicUrl` | — | |
| Hub | `SLAYZONE_HUB_AUTH_REQUIRED` | Enforce client auth on /trpc (`=1`) | off | — | — | |
| Hub | `SLAYZONE_HOME_DIR` | `~/.slayzone` root (config.json, hooks) | `$HOME/.slayzone` | — | **home** | |
| Runner | `SLAYZONE_HUB_URL` | `ws(s)://…/runners` to dial | from join token | `hubUrl` | — | |
