| Runner | `SLAYZONE_RUNNER_CREDENTIALS_DIR` | Post-enroll cred store dir | `~/.slayzone/runner` | — | **home** (raw os.homedir) | |
| Runner | `SLAYZONE_RUNNER_CONFIG` | Path to per-host JSON config file | — | — | — | |
| Runner | `SLAYZONE_RUNNER_HEARTBEAT_MS` | Heartbeat interval (ms) | — | — | — | |
| Runner | `SLAYZONE_HOME_DIR` | config.json root (runner reads shared config) | `$HOME/.slayzone` | — | **home** | |
