**Home-anchored (bold) = the 4 this task retargets to CWD:** `SLAYZONE_HOME_DIR`, `SLAYZONE_STORE_DIR`, `SLAYZONE_RUNNER_CREDENTIALS_DIR` (+ the raw-homedir credential-store gap).
